Domain entropy block for parent command line URLs

Place this after the exclusion macro and before suspicious_cmd.
| rex field=parent_cmd_l "(?i)https?://(?<parent_url_host>[^/\\s\"'<>]+)"
| eval parent_domain=lower(parent_url_host)
| eval parent_domain=replace(parent_domain, ":\d+$", "")
| eval parent_domain=replace(parent_domain, "^www\.", "")
| eval parent_domain_len=len(parent_domain)
| eval entropy_source=coalesce(parent_domain, "none")
| streamstats count as entropy_event_id
| rex max_match=0 field=entropy_source "(?<entropy_char>.)"
| mvexpand entropy_char
| eventstats count as char_count by entropy_event_id entropy_char
| eventstats count as entropy_len by entropy_event_id
| eval entropy_p=char_count/entropy_len
| eval entropy_component=-(entropy_p*(ln(entropy_p)/ln(2)))
| dedup entropy_event_id entropy_char
| eventstats sum(entropy_component) as parent_domain_entropy by entropy_event_id
| dedup entropy_event_id
| eval parent_domain_entropy=round(parent_domain_entropy, 3)
| eval suspicious_parent_domain_entropy=case(
    isnotnull(parent_domain) AND parent_domain_len>=12 AND parent_domain_entropy>=3.8, 1,
    true(), 0
)
| fields - entropy_char entropy_p entropy_component char_count entropy_len entropy_source entropy_event_id





Recommended starting threshold: parent_domain_len>=12 AND parent_domain_entropy>=3.8



