Add entropy into indicator:
Add this near the top of your indicator=case(...) block: suspicious_parent_domain_entropy=1, "browser_parent_high_entropy_domain",

Example:
| eval indicator=case(
    suspicious_parent_domain_entropy=1, "browser_parent_high_entropy_domain",

    child_process IN ("powershell.exe","pwsh.exe") AND (
        like(cmd_l, "%-enc%")
        OR like(cmd_l, "%-encodedcommand%")
        OR like(cmd_l, "%frombase64string%")
        OR like(cmd_l, "%iex%")
        OR like(cmd_l, "%downloadstring%")
        OR like(cmd_l, "%downloadfile%")
        OR like(cmd_l, "%invoke-webrequest%")
        OR like(cmd_l, "%iwr %")
    ), "browser_to_suspicious_powershell",


